### Register a new User (first run successfull, rest fails)
POST http://localhost:7070/api/v1/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Admin",
  "age": 32,
  "email": "admin@testing.com",
  "password": "test123",
  "phoneNumber": "12345678",
  "sex": "male",
  "height": 184,
  "currentWeight": 80.7
}

### Login with an existing user
POST localhost:7070/api/v1/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@testing.com",
  "password": "test123"
}

